gn=\"left\" height=\"16\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #000000; font-size: 10pt\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"35%\">\n<p><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\" height=\"16\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #000000; font-size: 10pt\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"35%\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 9pt\">냉기 \n                        </span><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">: </span></font><span style=\"font-size: 9pt\">60%</span></p>\n</td>\n<td align=\"left\" height=\"16\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #000000; font-size: 10pt\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"35%\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\">\n<font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font><span style=\"font-size: 9pt\">\n</span> </p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#c7b88f\" height=\"25\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #000000; font-size: 10pt\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/l_line.gif\" width=\"30\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://www.forg.co.kr/dungeon/image/r_line.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:30/16\" width=\"30\"></span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"absbottom\" border=\"0\" height=\"30\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/h.gif\" width=\"30\">ISTORY(</b>by<b>\n</b></span></font><font color=\"#3333FF\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>SIRL</b></span></font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>)</b></span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">신념을 \n            지키는데 실패한 기사는 저주를 받아 스켈레톤 나이트가 된다고 전해지고 \n            있는데 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">그보다 \n            몬데인이 자신의 세력을 넓히기 위해 죽은 기사에게 생명을 불어넣어 \n            소환한 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">것이 \n            아닐까 생각된다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:70%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">보통 \n            나무 방패와 시미터를 이용하며 갑옷은 비록 보이지 않지만 갑옷을 착용하고 \n            있다. 이들은 이미 죽었던 기사들이어서 그런지 공포심이라고 없어서 \n            절대로 도망가지 않는다. 또한 기사 출신이어서 그런지 그들의 근접 \n            공격력은 상당히 강한 편이라 숙련된 전사가 아니면 쉽게 이들을 쓰러트릴 \n            수 없다. 그러나 스켈레톤 나이트도 언데이드이기 때문에 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:5; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">실버에 \n            약한게 약점이다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/l_line.gif\" width=\"30\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://www.forg.co.kr/dungeon/image/r_line.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:30/16\" width=\"30\"></span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:120%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:2; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Comment \n                                        by </span></font><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>Pink</b></span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;: \n                                        </span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" bordercolordark=\"white\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"470\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"26\"> <p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://www.forg.co.kr/dungeon/image/pink.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"65\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:40/65\" width=\"40\"></b></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"424\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">원한에 사로잡혀 죽은자들의 무덤에서 불러낸 망령들이다. <br>기사들의 무덤만을 골라 소환해내었기때문에 모두 상당한 실력을 겸비하고 있어 \n상대하기가 곤란하다. </span></font> </p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p style=\"line-height:20%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">비록 살아있을때의 근력과 기술을 다 갖추진 못한다 하더라도 마법의 힘으로 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">어느정도까진 회복이 되었다. <br>방패와 \n칼등의 기본무기까지 갖추고있으며 일반 스켈레턴과는 상당한 차이가있음은 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">맞써 싸워본 이라면 누구나 알 \n            수 있을 것이다. </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:70%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">실버무기가 아니라면 \n그것에게 꽤 곤욕을 치루게됨은 자명한 사실이다. <br>초보여행자들은 대면할 일이 별로 없겠지만 혹시나 마주치게 된다면 침착하게 도망가라. \n<br>주위엔 많은 수의 몬스터들이 항상 죽치고있기때문에 도망가는것도 침착해야 할것이다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">\n</p><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:20%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n",
